{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8104-bd79-ddd48c4821ec }}
- **Description**: Turns TypeScript, Rust, and Python sources into language-agnostic IR fragments through a shared two-stage parse → bind contract. Each adapter resolves references to symbol-level edges with confidence scores, classifies polarity (Production, TestCase, TestSupport), and measures effective production SLOC per symbol (non-blank, non-comment, excluding doc comments, docstrings, and cfg(test) regions). This is the foundation every other feature consumes — the solver never sees language-specific constructs.
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8104-bd79-ddd48c4821ec }--
